@host = http://localhost:5298

### Estado dos servicos e timeout configurado
GET {{host}}/simulation

### Agregacao em PARALELO - custa o do servico mais lento (~410ms)
GET {{host}}/customers/c-1/dashboard

### Agregacao SEQUENCIAL - custa a soma (~800ms)
GET {{host}}/customers/c-1/dashboard?parallel=false

### Com correlation id do cliente - ele atravessa ate os tres servicos
GET {{host}}/customers/c-1/dashboard
X-Correlation-Id: rastreio-abc

### Prova de que o correlation id chegou em cada servico
GET {{host}}/simulation/correlations

### Recomendacoes FALHANDO
POST {{host}}/simulation/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "behavior": "Failing" }

### Resposta parcial: 200, completo=false, a parte que falhou marcada
GET {{host}}/customers/c-1/dashboard

### Pedidos LENTO (3s) contra timeout de 1200ms
POST {{host}}/simulation/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "behavior": "Slow" }

### O lento e cortado em 1200ms; os outros respondem normalmente
GET {{host}}/customers/c-1/dashboard

### Todos falhando -> o gateway responde 503
POST {{host}}/simulation/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "behavior": "Failing" }

### Restaura todos
POST {{host}}/simulation/reset
